      "en": "Every male among the priests may eat of it. It shall be eaten in a holy place. It is most holy.",
      "ko": "지극히 거룩하니 이것을 제사장의 남자마다 먹되 거룩한 곳에서 먹을찌며",
      "source_text_hash": "ef3b48bf3a50bd3a8c1ce199b5711d44530dd8e85b028b0a9fabf3086531c5e2",
      "translation_text_hash": "cdb382db9d58efb562199ada6cb6955be966b5c139785c4e358786dbcf593ab7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "지극히 거룩하니 이것을 제사장의 남자마다 먹되 거룩한 곳에서 먹을찌며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "cdb382db9d58efb562199ada6cb6955be966b5c139785c4e358786dbcf593ab7"
      ]
    },
    {
