      "en": "“‘As is the sin offering, so is the trespass offering; there is one law for them. The priest who makes atonement with them shall have it.",
      "ko": "속건제나 속죄제는 일례니 그 제육은 속하는 제사장에게로 돌아갈 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "a14965163eed577dc2e3799fe03a3057c5e212f34f8520b1fb7aa4fddc7aa514",
      "translation_text_hash": "f8f205a05a9d9cadc5500df8cdfc28f4de207d3b50b87a1a8e5ed89649e1a602",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "속건제나 속죄제는 일례니 그 제육은 속하는 제사장에게로 돌아갈 것이요"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f8f205a05a9d9cadc5500df8cdfc28f4de207d3b50b87a1a8e5ed89649e1a602"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:LEV:7:8",
