      "en": "Every meal offering that is baked in the oven, and all that is prepared in the pan and on the griddle, shall be the priest’s who offers it.",
      "ko": "무릇 화덕에 구운 소제물과 솥에나 번철에 만든 소제물은 그 드린 제사장에게로 돌아갈 것이니",
      "source_text_hash": "ccde20e516fd247ba4814451e766f9e6d268e14f2c4fdd123bac8d7bab6c73ad",
      "translation_text_hash": "4ce22aaba389a03cd57c8c33a833e28aa9ead7a545873f5df57ab98fc3daa5b7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "무릇 화덕에 구운 소제물과 솥에나 번철에 만든 소제물은 그 드린 제사장에게로 돌아갈 것이니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "4ce22aaba389a03cd57c8c33a833e28aa9ead7a545873f5df57ab98fc3daa5b7"
      ]
    },
