      "en": "Every meal offering, mixed with oil or dry, belongs to all the sons of Aaron, one as well as another.",
      "ko": "무릇 소제물은 기름 섞은 것이나 마른 것이나 아론의 모든 자손이 평균히 분배할 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "7bc4ed8e038669001dc559af37b542086ae7a71aab0fa3652891f41b25b3f32a",
      "translation_text_hash": "a40819fb0d423a1e4ca6a8a48275157b77363eb9bc9df8b798186c3e696ca391",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
