      "en": "“‘This is the law of the sacrifice of peace offerings, which one shall offer to the LORD:",
      "ko": "여호와께 드릴 화목제 희생의 규례는 이러하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "5996b032c4ddf837a0dfa16484774006a49f764f781c44a2b9e91eec1479113e",
      "translation_text_hash": "6694629f5b375b7f59a7ae5dc825170f7d54b0f0e7ee54cf5528419f833c2eea",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께 드릴 화목제 희생의 규례는 이러하니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "6694629f5b375b7f59a7ae5dc825170f7d54b0f0e7ee54cf5528419f833c2eea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:LEV:7:12",
      "sequence": 2892,
      "chapter_label": "LEV 7",
