      "en": "He shall offer his offering with the sacrifice of his peace offerings for thanksgiving with cakes of leavened bread.",
      "ko": "또 유교병을 화목제의 감사 희생과 함께 그 예물에 드리되",
      "source_text_hash": "8b351cd223dfe497fbd5d4164cd207d21d787e780be93d82eeac2cd16724a94a",
      "translation_text_hash": "cbfbab00a2b28713cac50e87a053ce5bc9368b690f59c5235edb1b0fa370e60c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "또 유교병을 화목제의 감사 희생과 함께 그 예물에 드리되"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "cbfbab00a2b28713cac50e87a053ce5bc9368b690f59c5235edb1b0fa370e60c"
      ]
    },
    {
