      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 7,
          "verse": 19
        }
      ],
      "en": "“‘The meat that touches any unclean thing shall not be eaten. It shall be burned with fire. As for the meat, everyone who is clean may eat it;",
      "ko": "그 고기가 부정한 물건에 접촉되었으면 먹지 말고 불사를 것이라 그 고기는 깨끗한 자만 먹을 것이니",
      "source_text_hash": "666b53c0208760e43097077a27e1c9b9361fcd4b2f19578a1aa29fae32a2a275",
      "translation_text_hash": "2d9b09f8c9e7b4b67ae29d5f255bbbfb6dea8c412ad80ef51e21c85695a8ce43",
