      "en": "The fat of that which dies of itself, and the fat of that which is torn of animals, may be used for any other service, but you shall in no way eat of it.",
      "ko": "스스로 죽은 것의 기름이나 짐승에게 찢긴 것의 기름은 달리는 쓰려니와 결단코 먹지 말찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "521b8f8202adb9577f6b4c9e30b9feae09cbfff7f317e8e8f9377680f0f7eeef",
      "translation_text_hash": "633ca74d20ae6350652cc4ec7bb181570ba9ba5703e05166c2545c2040a002b4",
